{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38669","headline":"山中寄崔谏议 · 李昭象","name":"山中寄崔谏议","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"半生猨鸟共山居，吟月吟风两鬓疎。\n新句未尝忘教化，上才争忍不吹嘘。\n全家欲去干戈後，大国中兴礼乐初。\n从此升腾休说命，秪希公道数封书。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李昭象","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38669.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38669","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}